Package: chanwer
Title: ChanWe Visual Themes for Quarto Workflows
Version: 2.3.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Chanwe",
           family = "Team",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "team@chanwe.example")
Description: Brand-consistent themes, color palettes, and utilities for
    ChanWe reporting workflows. Provides an editorial ggplot2 theme with
    custom title, subtitle, KPI-scoreboard, and caption elements, discrete
    and continuous color scales, a native Typst table generator for Quarto
    PDF reports, matching gt, reactable and plotly helpers for HTML output,
    font registration helpers, and Quarto-ready styling tokens for HTML and
    Typst outputs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/chanwe-ar/chanwer
BugReports: https://github.com/chanwe-ar/chanwer/issues
